// Cisco Clear Logs | T1070.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/cisco/aaa/cisco_cli_clear_logs.yml
*clear\ logging* OR *clear\ archive*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*clear\\ logging* OR *clear\\ archive*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
